## Coding Rules

- Always follow `.editorconfig` rules for indentation, whitespace, line endings, and final newline.

## Git Usage

- Do not create commits automatically or proactively. Commit only when the user explicitly asks to commit.
- Commit message subject (first line): no trailing period. The body below may use normal sentence punctuation, including periods.
